{"path":"io/c/clearerr","title":"std::clearerr","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>clearerr","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/clearerr","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Resets the error flags and the EOF indicator for the given file stream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdio\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> clearerr<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Resets the error flags and the <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c#Macro_constants\"><code>EOF</code></a> indicator for the given file stream.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> stream\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the file to reset the error flags for\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> tmpf <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/tmpfile\"><span class=\"kw1891\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tmpfile</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fputs\"><span class=\"kw1843\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fputs</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"cppreference.com<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/rewind\"><span class=\"kw1886\">std::<span class=\"me2\">rewind</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ch<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetc\"><span class=\"kw1838\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fgetc</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\"><span class=\"kw1898\">EOF</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/putchar\"><span class=\"kw1846\">std::<span class=\"me2\">putchar</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\"><span class=\"kw1887\">std::<span class=\"me2\">feof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// the loop is expected to terminate by EOF</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"End of file reached\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">clearerr</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// clear EOF</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\"><span class=\"kw1887\">std::<span class=\"me2\">feof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>tmpf<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"EOF indicator set\"</span>\n                              <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"EOF indicator cleared\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>cppreference.com\nEnd of file reached\nEOF indicator cleared</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>feof</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks for the end-of-file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/perror\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>perror</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  displays a character string corresponding of the current error to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stderr</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/ferror\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ferror</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks for a file error <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/clearerr\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>clearerr</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::clearerr","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Resets the error flags and the EOF indicator for the given file stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"stream"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"feof","note":"checks for the end-of-file"},{"label":"perror","note":"displays a character string corresponding of the current error to stderr"},{"label":"ferror","note":"checks for a file error"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":131,"codeBlockCount":2}
